pilot-briefing-text = [head=2]Pilot Briefing[/head]

    As a pilot, you have the skills required to operate a space shuttle. Under station regulations, you are also a Security Officer.

    - Patrol the space around the station at the discretion of the Head of Security, following all laws and Security Officer standard operating procedures.
    - When you are not piloting, perform the duties of a Security Officer.
    - Be ready for operational tasks, take responsibility for your actions, and respond competently to unexpected situations.
    - Flights during Green Alert are considered wasteful and are prohibited to conserve resources. Have a safe flight!
